  question: We are commanded to worship only God.  Should we pray to the Holy Spirit?
  answers:
  - No
  - Yes
  - Sometimes
  - Only when He deserves it
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: God commands mankind to worship Him along (Exodus 20:3) Since
